    <node id="&quot;PSYCHOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Psychology is a broad field of study that encompasses both psychiatry and other areas of mental health research, which Dr. Teresa Rushe is involved in."&lt;SEP&gt;"Psychology is an organization or field of study focused on the science of the mind and behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Psychology is the field of study that Dr. Teresa Rushe specializes in, both at the Institute of Psychiatry, Psychology and Neuroscience and in her current work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0288</data>
